    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RiftGuard</strong> is a roguelike action game with survival and resource management elements, set in a dark and mysterious world. <br>Take control of a hero who <strong>automatically attacks enemies</strong> while you focus on <strong>choosing upgrades, planning your strategy, and managing resources</strong> to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct enemy types, each with unique patterns and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game time tracker to monitor your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A health indicator for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coin counter that increases as you defeat enemies, used to unlock and upgrade abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blood counter, which also serves as the <strong>score</strong> for each run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 unique abilities</strong>, each with <strong>3 to 4 upgrade levels</strong>, allowing for powerful combinations tailored to your playstyle. <br>Make every choice count, adapt to the chaos, and fight to survive for as long as you can.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RiftGuard</strong> is a roguelike action game with survival and resource management elements, set in a dark and mysterious world. <br>Take control of a hero who <strong>automatically attacks enemies</strong> while you focus on <strong>choosing upgrades, planning your strategy, and managing resources</strong> to survive as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game currently features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 distinct enemy types, each with unique patterns and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game time tracker to monitor your progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A health indicator for your character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A coin counter that increases as you defeat enemies, used to unlock and upgrade abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A blood counter, which also serves as the <strong>score</strong> for each run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>9 unique abilities</strong>, each with <strong>3 to 4 upgrade levels</strong>, allowing for powerful combinations tailored to your playstyle. <br>Make every choice count, adapt to the chaos, and fight to survive for as long as you can.</p>",
    "short_description": "RiftGuard is a dark auto-action roguelike. Manage resources, collect upgrades, and survive relentless enemy hordes in intense, strategic combat filled with blood and chaos.",
